Third-party code incorporated in CafAI
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Crema (https://github.com/yarneo/crema), GPL-3.0
  Copyright (C) 2026 Yarden (yarneo). Licensed GPLv3 (GPL-3.0-only).
  CafAI ports non-UI logic from Crema's web/ folder (commit
  628cd714fa1a3a5194ea0e4c579d54ae1e38353c, v1.1.2): the Decaid gateway
  client and WebSocket handling, profile handling and required-field fixes,
  the coach prompt, proposal validation and change wording, shot curve
  analysis, provider calls, settings mirroring and the key store, safe-area
  handling, the web/dev/ipad.html device harness (CafAI's dev/tablet.html)
  and release tooling, together with the tests that cover them and Decaid
  payloads Crema recorded (mock/fixtures/crema.ts). Each ported file carries
  a header naming its Crema origin and stating that it was modified for
  CafAI. See docs/CREMA_PORT_PLAN.md.

MimojaCafe, a skin for Decent's de1app (https://github.com/decentespresso/de1app)
  Crema is a fork of the MimojaCafe skin for de1app, as Crema's README says.
  CafAI ports only Crema's web/ folder, which holds no MimojaCafe code
  (docs/CREMA_PORT_PLAN.md section 1.3); the lineage is credited all the same.

decaid-mcp (https://github.com/The-Walker443/decaid-mcp), GPL-3.0-or-later
  By The-Walker443; used here under GPL-3.0. src/coach/summary/analysis.ts
  ports its shot diagnostics (plugin.js sections 2-4 at commit
  aecef96b870e4f3567ed5f08c876f77adf25f5a7: first drops, preinfusion end,
  pressure peaks, puck resistance and the channeling indicators) with their
  thresholds unchanged; decaid-mcp ports them from decentespresso-mcp
  (https://github.com/The-Walker443/decentespresso-mcp). Four of its real
  shot records are test fixtures in src/coach/__fixtures__/decaid-mcp/ (see
  SOURCES.md in src/coach/__fixtures__/).

Decaid by Decent Espresso (https://github.com/decentespresso/decaid),
GPL-3.0-or-later
  Copyright (C) 2025-2026 Decent Espresso. Used here under GPL-3.0.
  - The coach templates in src/coach/templates/source/ are five of Decaid's
    bundled profiles, copied unchanged from assets/defaultProfiles with their
    author and notes fields intact (D-Flow and Londonium credit Damian
    Brakel in their notes). See SOURCES.md in that folder for exact origins.
  - src/coach/profileId.ts is a byte-exact port of Decaid's ProfileHash
    (lib/src/models/data/profile_hash.dart at a45961b), and
    src/coach/profile.ts reproduces its Profile.fromJson and toJson.
  - Not part of the skin: contract/decaid/spec/ holds Decaid's REST and
    WebSocket specs verbatim at v0.8.8 (aab5f93), from which the types in
    contract/decaid/generated/ are generated; src/coach/__fixtures__/ holds
    two of its bundled profiles as test vectors.

